Remixed\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 10; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, charts, bento, flow, effect.\n## Overview\nSystemic Blueprints UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nExecution Archetypes Map your systemic blueprint. Reveal the underlying architecture of your workflow. We categorize the core frameworks and protocols teams rely on to build, scale, and accelerate execution. Start Asses…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Map your systemic blueprint.; The Architect; The Optimizer; The Catalyst; The Accelerator.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #3B82F6, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #EAB134, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Systemic Blueprints - Remixed</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\">\n    <style>\n        .font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-neutral-950 text-neutral-50 antialiased font-sans selection:bg-neutral-800 selection:text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n    <!-- Container Lines Wrapper -->\n    <main class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1200px] border-x border-neutral-800/60 min-h-screen px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-12 py-24 md:py-32 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n\n        <!-- Corner Detail Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header Section -->\n        <header class=\"mb-16 md:mb-24 max-w-3xl flex flex-col items-start\">\n            <!-- Eyebrow -->\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-900/50 border border-neutral-800 text-xs font-normal text-neutral-400 mb-6 tracking-wide uppercase font-geist\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-300\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span>Execution Archetypes</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <h1 id=\"reveal-title\" class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.1] text-white mb-6 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">\n                Map your systemic blueprint.\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-lg text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-xl font-geist mb-8\">\n                Reveal the underlying architecture of your workflow. We categorize the core frameworks and protocols teams rely on to build, scale, and accelerate execution.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTA Button -->\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white text-neutral-950 px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-normal tracking-tight hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors duration-300 font-geist shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\">\n                Start Assessment\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Bento Grid Section -->\n        <section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 md:gap-6 w-full auto-rows-fr\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1a: The Architect (Span 2) -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-2 relative p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3BB795]/40 via-neutral-800/50 to-neutral-900 hover:from-[#3BB795]/60 transition-colors duration-700 group flex flex-col\">\n                <div class=\"h-full w-full flex flex-col justify-between bg-neutral-950 rounded-[15px] p-8 md:p-10 overflow-hidden relative flex-grow\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-[#3BB795]/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] group-hover:bg-[#3BB795]/20 transition-all duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <div id=\"grid-1\" class=\"w-full aspect-[2.5/1] grid gap-[1px] mb-12 opacity-80 mix-blend-screen\" style=\"grid-template-columns: repeat(16, 1fr); grid-template-rows: repeat(4, 1fr);\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto z-10 lg:w-4/5\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-normal tracking-tighter text-white mb-3 font-geist\">The Architect</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed font-geist\">\n                            Prioritizes absolute structural integrity, designing foundational systems built to handle infinite scale from day one without performance degradation.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 1b: The Optimizer (Span 1) -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-1 relative p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3B82F6]/40 via-neutral-800/50 to-neutral-900 hover:from-[#3B82F6]/60 transition-colors duration-700 group flex flex-col\">\n                <div class=\"h-full w-full flex flex-col bg-neutral-950 rounded-[15px] p-7 md:p-8 overflow-hidden relative flex-grow\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -bottom-20 -right-20 w-64 h-64 bg-[#3B82F6]/10 rounded-full blur-[80px] group-hover:bg-[#3B82F6]/20 transition-all duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <div id=\"grid-2\" class=\"w-full aspect-square grid grid-cols-8 grid-rows-8 gap-[1px] mb-8 opacity-70 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto z-10\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tighter text-white mb-2 font-geist\">The Optimizer</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed font-geist\">\n                            Focuses on resource efficiency, continuously tuning frameworks to achieve the highest possible output with minimal overhead.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: The Catalyst (Span 1) -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-1 relative p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#EAB134]/40 via-neutral-800/50 to-neutral-900 hover:from-[#EAB134]/60 transition-colors duration-700 group flex flex-col\">\n                <div class=\"h-full w-full flex flex-col bg-neutral-950 rounded-[15px] p-7 md:p-8 overflow-hidden relative flex-grow\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -top-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 bg-[#EAB134]/10 rounded-full blur-[80px] group-hover:bg-[#EAB134]/20 transition-all duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <div id=\"grid-3\" class=\"w-full aspect-square grid grid-cols-8 grid-rows-8 gap-[1px] mb-8 opacity-70 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto z-10\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tighter text-white mb-2 font-geist\">The Catalyst</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed font-geist\">\n                            Ruthlessly targets process latency, intuitively cutting unnecessary steps to systematically accelerate delivery cycles.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: The Accelerator (Span 2) -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-2 relative p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#E56F30]/40 via-neutral-800/50 to-neutral-900 hover:from-[#E56F30]/60 transition-colors duration-700 group flex flex-col\">\n                <div class=\"h-full w-full flex flex-col justify-between bg-neutral-950 rounded-[15px] p-8 md:p-10 overflow-hidden relative flex-grow\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -bottom-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-[#E56F30]/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] group-hover:bg-[#E56F30]/20 transition-all duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <div id=\"grid-4\" class=\"w-full aspect-[2.5/1] grid gap-[1px] mb-12 opacity-80 mix-blend-screen\" style=\"grid-template-columns: repeat(16, 1fr); grid-template-rows: repeat(4, 1fr);\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto z-10 lg:w-4/5 ml-auto text-left lg:text-right\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-normal tracking-tighter text-white mb-3 font-geist\">The Accelerator</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed font-geist\">\n                            Sparks rapid momentum and early progress, characterized by an exceptionally low tolerance for administrative friction and bloated setup phases.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n\n            // --- Grid Generation & Animation ---\n            const gridConfigs = ['grid-1', 'grid-2', 'grid-3', 'grid-4'];\n\n            gridConfigs.forEach((id) => {\n                const container = document.getElementById(id);\n                if (!container) return;\n\n                const cells = [];\n                const totalCells = 64;\n\n                for (let i = 0; i < totalCells; i++) {\n                    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n\n                    const rand = Math.random();\n                    let overlayStyle = 'background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0)';\n\n                    if (rand < 0.15) overlayStyle = 'background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.4)';\n                    else if (rand < 0.35) overlayStyle = 'background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.02)';\n                    else if (rand < 0.5) overlayStyle = 'background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05)';\n                    else if (rand < 0.7) overlayStyle = 'background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08)';\n                    else if (rand < 0.85) overlayStyle = 'background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12)';\n\n                    cell.className = 'w-full h-full rounded-[1px] transition-all duration-[600ms] ease-in-out';\n                    cell.style = overlayStyle;\n\n                    cell.dataset.originalStyle = overlayStyle;\n\n                    container.appendChild(cell);\n                    cells.push(cell);\n                }\n\n                setInterval(() => {\n                    const numToAnimate = Math.floor(Math.random() * 2) + 1;\n\n                    for(let k=0; k<numToAnimate; k++) {\n                        const randomIdx = Math.floor(Math.random() * cells.length);\n                        const cell = cells[randomIdx];\n\n                        cell.style = 'background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255,255,255,0.6); transform: scale(1.05); transition-duration: 200ms; transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); z-index: 10;';\n\n                        setTimeout(() => {\n                            cell.style = cell.dataset.originalStyle;\n                            cell.style.transitionDuration = '800ms';\n                        }, 400 + Math.random() * 600);\n                    }\n                }, 800);\n            });\n\n            // --- GSAP Masked Word Reveal ---\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const titleEl = document.getElementById('reveal-title');\n            if (titleEl) {\n                const text = titleEl.innerText;\n                titleEl.innerText = '';\n                titleEl.style.opacity = 1;\n\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n\n                words.forEach((word) => {\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                    wrapper.style.paddingRight = '0.3em';\n                    wrapper.style.lineHeight = '1.1';\n                    wrapper.style.paddingBottom = '0.1em';\n\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.innerText = word;\n                    inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    inner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n                    inner.style.transformOrigin = 'top left';\n\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    titleEl.appendChild(wrapper);\n                });\n\n                gsap.to('#reveal-title > span > span', {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    ease: 'power4.out',\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    stagger: 0.08,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: '#reveal-title',\n                        start: 'top 85%',\n                        toggleActions: 'play none none none'\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "systemic-blueprints-remixed.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/systemic-blueprints-remixed.jpg", "source_name": "systemic-blueprints-remixed-DESIGN.md", "views": 57, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": 